{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《商業內幕》報道，一場關鍵的英偉達財報電話會議，為誰可能接替黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)提供了重要線索。在周二召開的英偉達第三財季財報電話會議上，英偉達臨時CEO科萊特·克雷斯(Colette Kress)和董事長哈維·瓊斯(Harvey Jones)發表完事先準備好的講話後，一位引人注目的參與者被介紹出場：英偉達超大規模和高性能計算業務副總裁伊恩·巴克(Ian Buck)。他隨後與克雷斯一同參加了問答環節。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586922.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:17:26.007127+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:06:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_hash":"c3fede22e0c72ed22a218cd70519060a63a2dbeecf2c9790f93f31184167eb10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}